  "id": "Huruf diisi tekstur buatan sendiri (marmer, kayu, logam sikat, lava, kertas) yang bergeser pelan, atau tekstur dipakai sebagai topeng luminans yang melubangi huruf. Tekstur digambar di kanvas dari noise berseed, tanpa gambar luar.",
  "en": "Letters filled with a procedurally drawn texture (marble, wood, brushed metal, lava, paper) that pans slowly, or the texture used as a luminance mask that cuts holes through the glyphs. Seeded canvas noise, no external images."
